<title>RUSSIA: Russia Jan nickel, aluminium exports edge up yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Russia Jan nickel, aluminium exports edge up yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian exports of nickel in January rose to 12,800 tonnes compared to year-ago levels of 11,500 tonnes, the State Customs Committee said on Friday.</p>
<p>The committee, which reports its figures to Interfax news agency, also said that January primary aluminium exports were 213,300 tonnes, compared to January 1996 levels of 212,500 tonnes.</p>
<p>January copper exports rose to 43,700 tonnes from year-ago levels of 25,600 tonnes. Exports of ferroalloys were 18,000 after year-ago levels of 22,700 tonnes.</p>
<p>The committee did not provide month-on-month changes.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
